 "transcript": [
  {
   "start": 3.0,
   "end": 9.356,
   "text": "两个机房：左边放 2 个单元，右边放 3 个。人数不能变。",
   "sceneId": "s01-hook"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.356,
   "end": 15.267,
   "text": "跨房间的连线越多，代价越大：现在 cut = 12。",
   "sceneId": "s01-hook"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.267,
   "end": 20.067,
   "text": "能不能用一对一交换，把 cut 降下来？",
   "sceneId": "s01-hook"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.467,
   "end": 26.156,
   "text": "先给每个点算一个数：D = 外部边权 − 内部边权。",
   "sceneId": "s02-dvalue"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.156,
   "end": 31.4,
   "text": "A 的连线全在对面：D(A) = 6 − 0 = 6。",
   "sceneId": "s02-dvalue"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.4,
   "end": 35.533,
   "text": "D 大，说明这个点“想去对面”。",
   "sceneId": "s02-dvalue"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.533,
   "end": 39.667,
   "text": "五个点的 D 值都由当前分组算出。",
   "sceneId": "s02-dvalue"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.067,
   "end": 47.311,
   "text": "交换一对 a、b，收益是 D(a) + D(b) − 2w(a,b)。",
   "sceneId": "s03-pairs"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.311,
   "end": 51.667,
   "text": "把左右各一点配成 6 对，逐一计算。",
   "sceneId": "s03-pairs"
  },
  {
   "start": 51.667,
   "end": 56.022,
   "text": "最大的是 A↔D：6 + 3 − 0 = 9。",
   "sceneId": "s03-pairs"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.422,
   "end": 60.111,
   "text": "为什么要减 2w？看 E 与 D。",
   "sceneId": "s04-minus2w"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.111,
   "end": 67.578,
   "text": "D(E) + D(D) = 9，可是两个 D 都把边 DE 算成了“外部”。",
   "sceneId": "s04-minus2w"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.578,
   "end": 73.489,
   "text": "交换以后，E、D 依旧分处两侧——DE 还是被切。",
   "sceneId": "s04-minus2w"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.489,
   "end": 78.067,
   "text": "这条边被多算了两次，要扣回 2 × 5。",
   "sceneId": "s04-minus2w"
  },
  {
   "start": 78.067,
   "end": 83.756,
   "text": "所以 g(E, D) = 9 − 10 = −1，并不划算。",
   "sceneId": "s04-minus2w"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.156,
   "end": 88.067,
   "text": "第一步：选收益最大的 A↔D。",
   "sceneId": "s05-trial1"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.067,
   "end": 91.978,
   "text": "交换——cut 从 12 降到 3。",
   "sceneId": "s05-trial1"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.978,
   "end": 96.333,
   "text": "A、D 锁定。注意：这还只是试探。",
   "sceneId": "s05-trial1"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.733,
   "end": 101.756,
   "text": "重新计算 D。剩下的候选，收益全是负数。",
   "sceneId": "s06-trial2"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.756,
   "end": 107.444,
   "text": "KL 不停下：照样选最大的那个，E↔C，−8。",
   "sceneId": "s06-trial2"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.444,
   "end": 112.467,
   "text": "cut 暂时升到 11。这一步也只是试探。",
   "sceneId": "s06-trial2"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.867,
   "end": 118.333,
   "text": "一轮走完，回头看累计收益：0、+9、+1。",
   "sceneId": "s07-prefix"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.333,
   "end": 122.022,
   "text": "最大的是前 1 步，累计 +9。",
   "sceneId": "s07-prefix"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.022,
   "end": 125.711,
   "text": "所以只保留连续的前 1 步——",
   "sceneId": "s07-prefix"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.711,
   "end": 130.956,
   "text": "从本轮起点重来：只做 A↔D，cut = 3。",
   "sceneId": "s07-prefix"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.956,
   "end": 136.644,
   "text": "这就是回退：试探可以变差，接受只看最佳前缀。",
   "sceneId": "s07-prefix"
  },
  {
   "start": 137.044,
   "end": 140.511,
   "text": "从 ABC | DE 再来一轮。",
   "sceneId": "s08-pass2"
  },
  {
   "start": 140.511,
   "end": 144.2,
   "text": "累计收益：−8，然后 −6。",
   "sceneId": "s08-pass2"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.2,
   "end": 149.444,
   "text": "都不如什么都不做：空前缀胜出，算法停止。",
   "sceneId": "s08-pass2"
  },
  {
   "start": 149.844,
   "end": 154.422,
   "text": "把规则写成伪代码：外层一轮接一轮。",
   "sceneId": "s09-code"
  },
  {
   "start": 154.422,
   "end": 160.111,
   "text": "内层：选最大收益的一对，交换、锁定、更新 D。",
   "sceneId": "s09-code"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.111,
   "end": 165.578,
   "text": "一轮结束：取最佳前缀，从起点只应用这几步。",
   "sceneId": "s09-code"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.578,
   "end": 168.378,
   "text": "直到最佳前缀为空。",
   "sceneId": "s09-code"
  },
  {
   "start": 168.778,
   "end": 172.689,
   "text": "换一张图：把 AB 从 5 改成 1。",
   "sceneId": "s10-ab1"
  },
  {
   "start": 172.689,
   "end": 177.711,
   "text": "初始 cut 变成 8，A↔D 的收益变成 5。",
   "sceneId": "s10-ab1"
  },
  {
   "start": 177.711,
   "end": 182.733,
   "text": "同一个种子，图一变，所有 D 值都要重算。",
   "sceneId": "s10-ab1"
  },
  {
   "start": 183.133,
   "end": 185.267,
   "text": "KL 的边界：",
   "sceneId": "s11-limits"
  },
  {
   "start": 185.267,
   "end": 188.733,
   "text": "人数平衡不等于面积平衡。",
   "sceneId": "s11-limits"
  },
  {
   "start": 188.733,
   "end": 192.867,
   "text": "从不同种子出发，结果可能不同。",
   "sceneId": "s11-limits"
  },
  {
   "start": 192.867,
   "end": 197.0,
   "text": "下一章 FM：一次只移动一个点。",
   "sceneId": "s11-limits"
  }
 ],
